      "source_text": "（每个人都带着拼命的表情，\n竭尽全力地向着终点冲去――）",
      "source_fingerprint": "e90392ac9d5287dc56c64ed30033e35a260aa3ddb8b770cefb2fcafba6cbe3b2",
